<mjml lang="en">
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>Welcome to Coded Mails</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>Preview - Welcome to Coded Mails</mj-preview>
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-button
        border-radius="30px"
        text-transform="uppercase"
        font-weight="bold"
        font-size="14px"
        line-height="30px"
        background-color="#2e58ff"
        color="#ffffff"
      ></mj-button>
      <mj-all
        font-size="14px"
        line-height="20px"
        font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif"
      ></mj-all>
      <mj-text font-weight="400" font-size="18px" color="#434245" line-height="24px"></mj-text>
      <mj-class font-weight="bold" name="heading" />
      <mj-class color="#ACA9BB" name="footer-text" font-size="14px" />
      <mj-class color="#ACA9BB" name="light-text" font-size="16px" />
    </mj-attributes>
    <mj-style inline="inline">
      h1,
      h2 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 24px;
        line-height: normal;
        font-weight: bold;
      }

      p {
        margin: 0;
      }

      a {
        color: #2e58ff;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .receipt-table td {
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 20px;
        word-break: normal;
      }
    </mj-style>
    <mj-style>
      a,
      span,
      td,
      th {
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased !important;
        -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale !important;
      }
    </mj-style>
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body background-color="#ffffff">
    <mj-section padding-bottom="0px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image
          src="../../../images/logo-circle.png"
          alt="image description"
          align="left"
          width="50px"
        />
        <mj-text mj-class="heading">
          <h1>
            Hi John Doe, <br />
            here is your weekly digest
          </h1>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          <p>
            Compassion movements big data and scalable strengthening infrastructure social capital
            contextualize. Blended value challenges and opportunities dynamic parse.
          </p>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section>
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1496047160831-9aa3ac415852?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80"
        >
        </mj-image>
        <mj-text mj-class="heading" align="left">
          <p class="date">Janurary 13, 2020</p>

          <h2>Peaceful, a, social enterprise; inspiring support, shared value fairness.</h2>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          <p>
            B-corp issue outcomes, blended value do-gooder social intrapreneurship catalyze.
            Outcomes inclusive social entrepreneur, save the world B-corp or venture philanthropy a
            but.
          </p>
        </mj-text>

        <mj-button
          align="left"
          font-size="14px"
          line-height="24px"
          href="https://google.com"
          background-color="#2e58ff"
          color="white"
        >
          <strong>Read more</strong>
        </mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section>
      <mj-column width="50%">
        <mj-image
          fluid-on-mobile="true"
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1496046596374-a16aa8b8ae63?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80"
          alt="image description"
        />
        <mj-text mj-class="heading" align="left">
          <p class="date">Janurary 12, 2020</p>

          <h2>Targeted progress, innovation entrepreneur catalyze equal opportunity.</h2>
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text>
          <p>
            Social return on investment unprecedented challenge, gender rights venture philanthropy
            incubator resilient co-creation youth.
          </p>
        </mj-text>

        <mj-button
          align="left"
          font-size="14px"
          line-height="24px"
          href="https://google.com"
          background-color="#2e58ff"
          color="white"
        >
          <strong>Read more</strong>
        </mj-button>
      </mj-column>
      <mj-column width="50%">
        <mj-image
          fluid-on-mobile="true"
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1520864024919-cf7e44bff54c?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80"
          alt="image description"
        />
        <mj-text mj-class="heading" align="left">
          <p class="date">Janurary 12, 2020</p>

          <h2>Targeted progress, innovation entrepreneur catalyze equal opportunity.</h2>
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text>
          <p>
            Social return on investment unprecedented challenge, gender rights venture philanthropy
            incubator resilient co-creation youth.
          </p>
        </mj-text>

        <mj-button
          align="left"
          font-size="14px"
          line-height="24px"
          href="https://google.com"
          background-color="#2e58ff"
          color="white"
        >
          <strong>Read more</strong>
        </mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#f4f4f4">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text mj-class="heading" align="left">
          <p class="date">Janurary 13, 2020</p>

          <h2>Social enterprise; inspiring support, shared value fairness.</h2>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          <p>
            B-corp issue outcomes, blended value do-gooder social intrapreneurship catalyze.
            Outcomes inclusive social entrepreneur, save the world B-corp or venture philanthropy a
            but.
          </p>
        </mj-text>

        <mj-button
          align="left"
          font-size="14px"
          line-height="24px"
          href="https://google.com"
          background-color="#2e58ff"
          color="white"
        >
          <strong>Read more</strong>
        </mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section>
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text>
          <p>
            We hope you find these resources helpful, and we’ll be in touch again next week with
            more updates.
          </p>
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text mj-class="heading"> Team Coded Mails </mj-text>
        <mj-social mode="horizontal" align="left">
          <mj-social-element
            alt="twitter-logo"
            icon-size="18px"
            src="../../../images/social/black/twitter-logo-transparent-black.png"
            href="#"
          ></mj-social-element>
          <mj-social-element
            alt="facebook-logo"
            icon-size="18px"
            src="../../../images/social/black/facebook-logo-transparent-black.png"
            href="#"
          ></mj-social-element>
          <mj-social-element
            alt="instagram-logo"
            icon-size="18px"
            src="../../../images/social/black/instagram-logo-transparent-black.png"
            href="#"
          ></mj-social-element>
        </mj-social>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section padding-top="0">
  <mj-column width="100%">
    <mj-divider border-width="1px" border-style="dashed" border-color="lightgrey" />
    <mj-text align="left" mj-class="footer-text">
      Have questions or need help? Email us at

      <a href="#"> info@codedmails.com </a>
    </mj-text>

    <mj-text mj-class="light-text">
      123 Medalling Jr., Suite 100, Parrot Park, CA 12345<br />
      © 2020 [Coded Mails] Inc.
    </mj-text>
    <mj-text mj-class="footer-text">
      Update your <a href="https://google.com">email preferences</a> to choose the types of emails
      you receive, or you can <a href="https://google.com"> unsubscribe </a>from all future emails.
    </mj-text>
  </mj-column>
</mj-section>
    <mj-section>
  <mj-column>
    <mj-spacer height="1px"></mj-spacer>
  </mj-column>
</mj-section>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
